{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11115221","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115221","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1111522101:1":{"text":"Oh, dearest Phraesto, you shaped up to be quite a disappointment, didn't you?","source_cn":"哎呀呀……普鲁斯托，你这家伙太令我失望了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A66EA7FEB090EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522102:1":{"text":"With all that power of yours, failure did not seem an option.","source_cn":"我还以为凭你的力量，这次一定不会失手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49146C169885BDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522103:1":{"text":"Having said that, what sort of power must they have been granted by the gods?","source_cn":"不过话说回来，他们从神明那里得到的力量是什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B163D8804AC4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522104:1":{"text":"To be able to deliver a fatal blow to a Hypogean is... concerning.","source_cn":"那个能够给予恶魔最后一击的力量……究竟是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x331085D5535FF14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522105:1":{"text":"This warrants a proper investigation.","source_cn":"有必要好好调查一番。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC422BB9340A9653D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111522106:1":{"text":"I hate it... Scheming is not my forte. And <style=\"highlight\">Their Excellency</style> is always giving me the most difficult tasks.","source_cn":"唉，真讨厌，我最不擅长动脑子了。<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E10FFA32A0FBA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111522107:1":{"text":"Oh, never mind... I'll simply have to try harder so as not to anger them.","source_cn":"算了算了……为了不惹祂老人家生气，我就再努力一点吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x320A51FBD3872174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:11010116:0":{"text":"In the tranquil depths of the Dusk Lord's tomb, Berial silently appears.","source_cn":"恢复平静的残阳神墓穴中，贝利尔悄无声息地出现了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7E2BACDAA84B791","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贝利尔":{"text":"Berial","source":"贝利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}